From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:06:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 095/144] GreatDANE: bundle tippytop icons for the Dane default
 top-site tiles (NGD round 2 M4)

Without a bundled icon, the new-tab page renders a screenshot of each default tile. This adds exact-host
tippytop entries, which use Mozilla's own top_sites.json + jar.mn mechanism. jar.mn already wildcards
content/tippytop/*:
  pepecoin.surf, dogecoin.surf, greatdane.doge, grokipedia.com (background_color #fff)
youtube.com, amazon.com and x.com were already covered upstream. There are no pref or identifier
changes, and screenshots are not disabled.

Icon sources and rights are in greatdane/tippytop-ICON-SOURCES.md. The three Dane hosts use local
site or branding art. Grokipedia had no local asset and was fetched from the live site favicon on
2026-11-10. greatdane/tests/tippytop_default_sites_check.py checks that every default.sites host has
an entry with existing files.
